  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nLonging for light, a sunless world begins devouring itself. Every step shifts the landscape beneath you as you search for what remains of her.<p></p>\n<p>Eclipsium is a first-person horror game where you play as the desperate Wanderer. In search of Her, his path leads through hellish tombs, cathedrals of flesh and even through space, immolating himself and sacrificing anything to achieve his goal.</p>\n<p>Don’t stop – There is no safety or comfort in Eclipsium. Let the pale light guide you through, as every place hides its own path to escape.<br>\nEnter the spiral – Everything fades and senses dull in this endless darkness. But with you remains your power – a twisting, transmuting hand, ready to carve a way through whatever stands before you.<br>\nFind her – Her weak light, now little more than a whisper of a memory, pulls you forward. Even if it’s a lure, it remains your only hope inside the anguished eclipse.<br>\n</p>",
